Description: Linux 4k intro released in 2004
 piNp is a 4k intro by the Finnish group Faemiyah, written in x86
 assembly with SDL 1.2, OpenGL and GLUT. Code by Trilkk, music by
 Juippi, additional code by Warma. The soundtrack is synthesized at
 startup.
 .
 It was released at Assembly 2004 and ranked 10th in the 4k intro
 competition.
